      outputs: app/src/rules/doc-convert.js, app/src/model/import.js, app/src/ui/import.js, llm/connector.convertDocumentWith, app.previewImport·importUniverse·exportJson, app/data/doc-example.js, 머리글 「가져오기·내보내기」·시작 화면 「문서·파일 가져오기」, tests/convert.test.js(15)·import.test.js(10)·fixtures/doc-edu.js, 브라우저 점검 T-17 단계
